    "type": "game",
    "name": "FallingBattle",
    "steam_appid": 3703740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember the addictive classic &quot;NS-SHAFT / Downstairs Kid / 100 Floors Down if You\u2019re a Man&quot;\uff1f</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We were inspired by its gameplay to create an all-new original, wild, and chaotic multiplayer party version!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFallingBattle\u300bis a 2D action party game for 1 to 32 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple yet addictive: keep descending, dodge obstacles, and stay alive\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t think your old tricks will crown you king\u2014this time we\u2019ve added <strong>items</strong>, <strong>troll mechanics</strong>, and <strong>chaotic interactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014Even eliminated players can stir the pot from the sidelines, turning the battlefield into pure mayhem\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features\uff1a</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 Up to <strong>32 players online</strong>\u2014unlimited madness in every match\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 Tons of <strong>items and traps</strong> to sabotage friends or turn the tide\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>Eliminated? Not useless!</strong> Throw chaos into the game with surprise attacks and interference\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 A wild and <strong>troll-filled atmosphere</strong> that guarantees laughs and unexpected moments every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Easy to pick up, hard to master</strong>\u2014perfect for parties, streaming, or just watching your friends lose it\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a platforming pro, party game fanatic, or just here to watch your friends fail, this game is sure to make you laugh out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to descend with your friends... and fall into total madness?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember the addictive classic &quot;NS-SHAFT / Downstairs Kid / 100 Floors Down if You\u2019re a Man&quot;\uff1f</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We were inspired by its gameplay to create an all-new original, wild, and chaotic multiplayer party version!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFallingBattle\u300bis a 2D action party game for 1 to 32 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple yet addictive: keep descending, dodge obstacles, and stay alive\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t think your old tricks will crown you king\u2014this time we\u2019ve added <strong>items</strong>, <strong>troll mechanics</strong>, and <strong>chaotic interactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014Even eliminated players can stir the pot from the sidelines, turning the battlefield into pure mayhem\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features\uff1a</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 Up to <strong>32 players online</strong>\u2014unlimited madness in every match\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 Tons of <strong>items and traps</strong> to sabotage friends or turn the tide\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>Eliminated? Not useless!</strong> Throw chaos into the game with surprise attacks and interference\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 A wild and <strong>troll-filled atmosphere</strong> that guarantees laughs and unexpected moments every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Easy to pick up, hard to master</strong>\u2014perfect for parties, streaming, or just watching your friends lose it\uff01</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a platforming pro, party game fanatic, or just here to watch your friends fail, this game is sure to make you laugh out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to descend with your friends... and fall into total madness?</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aFallingBattle\u300bis a 2D action party game that supports 1 to 32 players.The rules are simple: keep descending, dodge obstacles, and survive!Grab items to sabotage your opponents and show them who the true King of the Fall really is!",
